# Internal working documents: never in the public repo.
HANDOFF-*.md
PLAN-*.md

# Lockfile: this repo cannot carry a portable one. node_modules/ is populated
# by runtime links to the Pi package (tests/_helpers.mjs --link-deps), and npm
# records those links in the lockfile as "extraneous" entries holding the
# ABSOLUTE path of the local installation, so the file would differ on any
# other machine. The real dependency (typescript) is declared in package.json.
package-lock.json
